red Ice"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Factory-installed icemaker in the freezer"},{"type":"Headline","text":"Monitor Ounces Dispensed"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Track your environmental impact by seeing how many plastic water bottles you have eliminated from the environment today, this week, this month, or this year by using a reusable water bottle."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Dual-Dispense AutoFill Pitcher"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"The Dual-Dispense AutoFill Pitcher is dishwasher safe and BPA-free."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Refills Throughout the Home"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Have access to filtered water throughout the home by removing the Dual-Dispense AutoFill Pitcher from the dock to have refills on hand, whether gathering on the patio, in the dining room, or anywhere in between."}],"documents":[{"label":"Quick Specifications","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/e2fadd31-4d9b-4be3-8cf0-ffa9ec5bdded.pdf"},{"label":"Manual","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/6f4665d2-89a2-4b10-81b2-533872b38fd5.pdf"},{"label":"Energy Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/51ab0991-f753-4bd6-bd00-3537912eace8.pdf"},{"label":"Warranty","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/6f17c942-794d-4a3c-bc37-b2028dc6559e.pdf"}],"specs":[{"name":"General Specs","rows":[{"name":"Color","value":"Stainless Steel"},{"name":"Color/Finish Name","value":"Fingerprint Resistant Stainless Steel"},{"name":"Door Color","value":"Fingerprint Resistant Stainless Steel"},{"name":"Handle Color","value":"Fingerprint Resistant Stainless Steel"},{"name":"Fingerprint Resistant Finish","value":"Yes"},{"name":"Type of Refrigerator","value":"French Door Refrigerator"},{"name":"Installation Type","value":"Freestanding"},{"name":"Manufacturer Recommended Water Filter","value":"XWFE"},{"name":"Depth Type","value":"Standard Depth"},{"name":"Number of Doors","value":"4"},{"name":"Total Capacity (cu. ft.)","value":"28.65"},{"name":"Refrigerator Capacity (cu. ft.